{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00057","headline":"开元后乐 · 薛逢","name":"开元后乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫奏开元旧乐章，乐中歌曲断人肠。邠王玉笛三更咽， 虢国金车十里香。一自犬戎生蓟北，便从征战老汾阳。 中原骏马搜求尽，沙苑年来草又芳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/curated_00057.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00057","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于与开放语料未能唯一对齐，保留为整理本异文/组诗条目、古籍注评：《唐诗鼓吹》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/唐詩鼔吹_(四庫全書本)）","citation":"周振甫"}